WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.799
Data bindings are perhaps the most

00:00:01.799 --> 00:00:03.679
critical mechanical component.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.580
This is the wiring that connects

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.359
these abstract high -level concepts

00:00:07.359 --> 00:00:09.220
back to the physical source fields

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:10.399
in your actual databases.

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:12.200
Okay, so it points to the

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.000
database. It's the mapping that tells

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.559
the ontology, hey, when the user

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:17.680
asks about a region, do not

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.640
hallucinate an answer, go look specifically

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.400
at column F in this exact

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.520
Lakehouse table.
